{
  "id": "JOB.34",
  "number": "34",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 34",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "34",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "34",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Furthermore Elihu answered and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear my words, O ye wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and give ear unto me, ye that have knowledge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the ear trieth words, as the mouth tasteth meat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us choose to us judgment: let us know among ourselves what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Job hath said, I am righteous: and God hath taken away my judgment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Should I lie against my right? my wound",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "incurable without transgression.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like Job,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "who",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "drinketh up scorning like water?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which goeth in company with the workers of iniquity, and walketh with wicked men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he hath said, It profiteth a man nothing that he should delight himself with God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore hearken unto me, ye men of understanding: far be it from God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that he should do",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wickedness; and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "from",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Almighty,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that he should commit",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iniquity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the work of a man shall he render unto him, and cause every man to find according to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ways.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, surely God will not do wickedly, neither will the Almighty pervert judgment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who hath given him a charge over the earth? or who hath disposed the whole world?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he set his heart upon man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he gather unto himself his spirit and his breath;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All flesh shall perish together, and man shall turn again unto dust.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If now",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thou hast",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "understanding, hear this: hearken to the voice of my words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall even he that hateth right govern? and wilt thou condemn him that is most just?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Is it fit",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to say to a king,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Thou art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wicked?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to princes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ye are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ungodly?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "How much less to him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that accepteth not the persons of princes, nor regardeth the rich more than the poor? for they all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the work of his hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In a moment shall they die, and the people shall be troubled at midnight, and pass away: and the mighty shall be taken away without hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
