          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For his eyes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the ways of man, and he seeth all his goings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no darkness, nor shadow of death, where the workers of iniquity may hide themselves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he will not lay upon man more",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "than right;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that he should enter into judgment with God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall break in pieces mighty men without number, and set others in their stead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore he knoweth their works, and he overturneth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the night, so that they are destroyed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He striketh them as wicked men in the open sight of others;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because they turned back from him, and would not consider any of his ways:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So that they cause the cry of the poor to come unto him, and he heareth the cry of the afflicted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he giveth quietness, who then can make trouble? and when he hideth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "face, who then can behold him? whether",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it be done",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against a nation, or against a man only:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That the hypocrite reign not, lest the people be ensnared.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely it is meet to be said unto God, I have borne",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "chastisement",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will not offend",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any more:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "That which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I see not teach thou me: if I have done iniquity, I will do no more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Should it be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "according to thy mind? he will recompense it, whether thou refuse, or whether thou choose; and not I: therefore speak what thou knowest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let men of understanding tell me, and let a wise man hearken unto me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Job hath spoken without knowledge, and his words",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "without wisdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My desire",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.36",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.36"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Job may be tried unto the end because of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.36",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.36"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "answers for wicked men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 34:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he addeth rebellion unto his sin, he clappeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his hands",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.34.37",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.34.37"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "among us, and multiplieth his words against God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.34.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.34.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
